  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Clean Cooking Action in West Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In close consultation with EnDev, the European Commission mobilised EUR 10.5 million regional funds for a Regional Action on Clean Cooking in West Africa. ReCCAWA intends to deliver on: 1) regional and national clean cooking policy development and implementation support; 2) promotion of supply of clean cooking solutions; 3) promotion of demand for clean cooking solutions; and 4) build an energy database at regional level. The aim is to coordinate between regional and national activities and to increase synergies between EU Member States activities and beyond. This collaboration fits under the Team Europe Africa Europa Green Energy Initiative (AEGEI). The activity will be implemented by RVO and the Spanish Development Agency AECID.</narrative>
  </description>
